(7411696, 1168309, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure why this appeals to me so much.  Ok, yeah...there is the dude, who has a certain Chuck Norris/JCV "its OK, you''re safe with me" thing going on, and I can''t dismiss the appeal of THAT!  To me he presents a more powerful presence than I would have thought with all that land as a background.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure why this appeals to me so much.  Ok, yeah...there is the dude, who has a certain Chuck Norris/JCV "its OK, you''re safe with me" thing going on, and I can''t dismiss the appeal of THAT!  To me he presents a more powerful presence than I would have thought with all that land as a background.  I like this a lot.', '2015-10-22 18:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7411808, 1168303, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great potential here. The image of a lonely mom who is by definition no alone is quite emotive. <br/>It will likely get slapped down pretty well due to selective saturation (DPC no-no =) Keeping them as a colorless part of the landscape would have forced the eye to bounce around more appropriately without the intervention.</td>', 'Great potential here. The image of a lonely mom who is by definition no alone is quite emotive. It will likely get slapped down pretty well due to selective saturation (DPC no-no =) Keeping them as a colorless part of the landscape would have forced the eye to bounce around more appropriately without the intervention.', '2015-10-23 09:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
