(7412990, 1168328, 147314, '<td valign="top">Well done Paul, congrats on the Blue!</td>', 'Well done Paul, congrats on the Blue!', '2015-10-29 07:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7412991, 1168331, 147314, '<td valign="top">Although this image meets the challenge well, I''m very curious about one or two processing issues. First, the colour of the apples in his hand really looks weird on my screen (not natural, quite oversaturated) and second, the background shows a dark green line between the hills on the right and the sky, often as a result of adjusting local contrast/clarity too much. I''m a big fan of your images, but truly I can''t understand the high score score for this image. Nevertheless congratulations with your TT, you really are doing great in the Unofficial DPC Point &amp; Ribbon Race 2015!</td>', 'Although this image meets the challenge well, I''m very curious about one or two processing issues. First, the colour of the apples in his hand really looks weird on my screen (not natural, quite oversaturated) and second, the background shows a dark green line between the hills on the right and the sky, often as a result of adjusting local contrast/clarity too much. I''m a big fan of your images, but truly I can''t understand the high score score for this image. Nevertheless congratulations with your TT, you really are doing great in the Unofficial DPC Point & Ribbon Race 2015!', '2015-10-29 07:44:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7412992, 1168309, 147314, '<td valign="top">This is you Alessandro? Really nice portrait, but somehow I''m sure the background isn''t your natural habitat, am I right?</td>', 'This is you Alessandro? Really nice portrait, but somehow I''m sure the background isn''t your natural habitat, am I right?', '2015-10-29 07:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7413055, 1168309, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> This is you Alessandro? Really nice portrait, but somehow I''m sure the background isn''t your natural habitat, am I right? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Much more central Scotland, isn''t it? ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: This is you Alessandro? Really nice portrait, but somehow I''m sure the background isn''t your natural habitat, am I right?   Much more central Scotland, isn''t it? ;)', '2015-10-29 20:22:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7413141, 1168273, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>What a lovely portrait of a lovely girl in a lovely dress sitting on lovely steps! All the colours work really well together, apart from the brown supports for the steps, given the lovely blend of the major elements together I may have been tempted to recolour them to something closer to the steps but its a minor point really. She is a very attractive lady and looks delightful the way she is dressed she has a lovely smile and those ruby red lips are so enticing. <br/> <br/>Your focus is where it should be on her face and the DOF has everything that needs to be sharp nicely covered with softness helping her to stand out from the background. The steps above her are leading to the unknown that intrigues us and keeps us interested but still focused on her. <br/> <br/>It all works well and was respectfully received by your voters, well done, Sid</td>', 'Hello from the Critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well What a lovely portrait of a lovely girl in a lovely dress sitting on lovely steps! All the colours work really well together, apart from the brown supports for the steps, given the lovely blend of the major elements together I may have been tempted to recolour them to something closer to the steps but its a minor point really. She is a very attractive lady and looks delightful the way she is dressed she has a lovely smile and those ruby red lips are so enticing.  Your focus is where it should be on her face and the DOF has everything that needs to be sharp nicely covered with softness helping her to stand out from the background. The steps above her are leading to the unknown that intrigues us and keeps us interested but still focused on her.  It all works well and was respectfully received by your voters, well done, Sid', '2015-10-30 12:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
